[I] Build distroless images with Alpine tools

[T] Witchery is a collection of composable tools to build distroless
[T] container images. It converts an application payload into an apk package
[T] and uses the native package manager of apk based distributions such as
[T] Alpine to assemble the image.

[U] https://github.com/witchery-project/witchery

[A] Witchery Authors
[M] René Rebe <rene@exactco.de>

